                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "i picked up this game on a whim years ago, albeit discounted on a badge-craft voucher.\n\nA simple yet honest game, its controls feel responsive and the content is fun. i spent many hours having a blast with it, especially when i was younger and i had little money to my name (and a potato of a pc).\n\nThe main highlight is the variety of ships/characters, each with different guns and gameplay styles. I'm not much for the anime catboys, but there's a charm to assigning each ship a pilot. \n\nA rare gem in what is usually a poor selection of steam-voucher gamers, and a diamond in the rough.",
